{
  "job_C11.10_20251003_115126": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fee ofer heofonas synd drihtne Benedicite aqu\u00eb omnes qu\u00eb super c\u00eblos sunt domino. M\u00e6gnu benedicite omnes uirtutes domini domino. Sunne & monan drihtne Benedicite sol et luna domino. Steorran drihtne benedicite stelle caeli domino. Hagul & deaw Benedicite omnis ymber et ros domino. Gastas godes benedicite omnes spiritus dei domino. Fyr swola\u00f0 Benedicite ignis et estus domino. Cyle & swola\u00f0 drihtne benedicite frigus et estas domino. Deawas & gycelgebland Benedicite rores et pruina domino. Forst & cyle benedicite gelu et frigus domino. Is & snaw Benedicite glacies et niues domino. Niht & dagas Benedicite noctes et dies domino. Leoht & \u00f0ystru Benedicite lux et tenebr\u00eb domino. Ligr\u00e6sas & genipu benedicite fulgvra et nubes domino. Bletsia\u00f0 eor\u00f0an drihten hera\u00f0 & oferblissie hine on worulda Benedicat terra dominum laudet et Bletsia\u00f0 muntas & beorgas drihtne Benedicite montes et colles domino. Ealle growende on eor\u00f0an benedicite uniuersa germinantia in terra domino. Bletsia\u00f0 wyllas Benedicite fontes domino. S\u00e6 & flod drihtne benedicite maria et flumina domino. Bletsia\u00f0 hwalas & ealle \u00f0e beo\u00f0 astyrode on w\u00e6terum drihtne Benedicite c\u00ebte et omnia que Bletsia\u00fe ealle fugelas heofonas benedicite omnes uolucres caeli domino. Bletsia\u00f0 ealle wyldeor & nitenu Benedicite omnes besti\u00eb et pecora domino. Bletsia\u00f0 bearn manna drihtne benedicite filii hominum domino. Bletsia",
